{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:starling:contracts:mode-routing:transform-result:v1",
  "$comment": [
    "Starling transform result, v1 (#293). What a provider returned for one",
    "request. A result never changes a draft by itself: the draft judges it",
    "as a proposal against its current revision (tests/staging.py), and the",
    "raw attempts are never touched by any status here.",
    "completed carries text (possibly empty: S1-mini returns nothing for a",
    "filler-only take) and no failure; failed/cancelled carry a typed",
    "failure and no text.",
    "failure.reason is the typed vocabulary the pipeline surfaces:",
    "timeout, cancelled, transport_error, redirect_blocked (3xx refused),",
    "rate_limited (429), http_error, unknown_model, malformed_response",
    "(unparseable or missing fields), empty_output (a provider that must",
    "answer returned nothing), truncated_output (stopped by a length limit",
    "or over max_output_chars), unsupported_language, unsupported_kind,",
    "remote_forbidden (a local_only request met a remote provider),",
    "provider_unavailable, invalid_input.",
    "timing: queued_ms (submit to dispatch), processing_ms (the provider",
    "call), stop_to_result_ms (capture stop to this result; null when the",
    "stop time is unknown). These are the per-job latencies #308 and #226",
    "read; no text ever goes into them."
  ],
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "schema_version",
    "request_id",
    "base_revision",
    "status",
    "text",
    "failure",
    "provider",
    "timing"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "const": 1
    },
    "request_id": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/token"
    },
    "base_revision": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 0
    },
    "status": {
      "enum": [
        "completed",
        "failed",
        "cancelled"
      ]
    },
    "text": {
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ]
    },
    "failure": {
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "type": "null"
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "reason",
            "retryable",
            "detail"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "reason": {
              "enum": [
                "timeout",
                "cancelled",
                "transport_error",
                "redirect_blocked",
                "rate_limited",
                "http_error",
                "unknown_model",
                "malformed_response",
                "empty_output",
                "truncated_output",
                "unsupported_language",
                "unsupported_kind",
                "remote_forbidden",
                "provider_unavailable",
                "invalid_input"
              ]
            },
            "retryable": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "detail": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "provider": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/providerRef"
    },
    "timing": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "queued_ms",
        "processing_ms",
        "stop_to_result_ms"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "queued_ms": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "processing_ms": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "stop_to_result_ms": {
          "type": [
            "number",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 0
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "token": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_.:-]{1,128}$"
    },
    "route": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_.-]+$",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "providerKind": {
      "enum": [
        "builtin",
        "s1",
        "openai_compatible",
        "anthropic",
        "gemini"
      ]
    },
    "providerRef": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "id",
        "kind",
        "locality",
        "route",
        "model",
        "artifact_sha256"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/token"
        },
        "kind": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/providerKind"
        },
        "locality": {
          "enum": [
            "local",
            "remote"
          ]
        },
        "route": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/route"
        },
        "model": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "artifact_sha256": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
